Components bundled only in the AppImage
---------------------------------------

The AppImage contains a compiler toolchain, used once on the player's machine
to build the game from their own disc image:

    GCC and binutils     GPL-3.0-or-later, with the GCC Runtime Library Exception
    CMake                BSD-3-Clause
    Ninja                Apache-2.0
    Python (CPython)     PSF License 2.0
    zlib, libpng, FreeType, xz (liblzma), linked statically
                         zlib License, libpng License, FreeType License (FTL),
                         0BSD / public domain

Source for each of these is available from its upstream project at the
version recorded in packaging/Dockerfile.

